    "result_text": "The full test suite is green. \n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `selfLink` field on the owner response so that `GET /api/owners/{id}` returns `selfLink = \"/api/owners/\" + id`.\n\nTwo changes:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a `selfLink` property (read-only string, `/api/owners/<id>`) to the `Owner` schema, which generates the `selfLink` field, getter, and setter on `OwnerDto`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct mapping `@Mapping(target = \"selfLink\", expression = \"java(\\\"/api/owners/\\\" + owner.getId())\")`, so every owner mapped to a DTO carries its self link.\n\nSince both the GET (`RespondWithOwner`) and POST (`MapOwner`) pipelines produce the DTO through `OwnerMapper.toOwnerDto`, the field is populated everywhere consistently \u2014 matching the derived-field pattern already used for `displayName`, `customerCode`, etc.\n\n`AcceptanceTest.coreReturnsSelfLink` passes and the full suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 1 test, 0 failures).",
